  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida Studies Series erbjuder ett urval av rapporterna best&#xe4;llda av Sida. Urvalet g&#xf6;rs f&#xf6;r att reflektera &#xe4;mnen av relevans f&#xf6;r Sidas policys och praxis, dock varje rapport uttrycker dess f&#xf6;rfattares syn och material. Serierna kastar ljus &#xf6;ver &#xe4;mnen som &#xe4;r viktiga i utvecklingspolicys f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rv. och har producerats specielt f&#xf6;r dem som &#xf6;nskar att g&#xe5; djupare in i dessa &#xe4;mnen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SidaStudiesSeries offers a selection of the reports commissioned by Sida.The selection is made to reflect issues of relevance to Sida&apos;s policies and practices; each report expresses the views and findings of its writer(s.The series sheds light on issues of importance in current developm. policies &amp; has been produced particularly f.those who wish to go into greater depth of these issues</narrative>
  </description>
